      "body": "Are magic values expected to always be 4 bytes? Would future modules using these helpers also be expected to use 4 bytes for them? If so, would it make sense to define a constant for the magic size instead of hardcoding 4, in order to make that assumption explicit?\n\nMaybe I'm missing something here.",
